【详解】(1) $\left\{\begin{array}{c}x=y+1(1) \\ 4 x-3 y=5(2)\end{array}\right.$ 把(1)代入(2)得: $4(y+1)-3 y=5$ 解得 $y=1$把 $\mathrm{y}=1$ 代入 (1)得: $\mathrm{x}=2 \quad \therefore$ 方程组的解为 $\left\{\begin{array}{l}x=2 \\ y=1\end{array}\right.$;

(2) $\left\{\begin{array}{l}3 x-2 y=7(1) \\ 3 x+2 y=11(2)\end{array}\right.$ (1)+(2)得: $6 x=18$ 解得: $x=3$

(2)-(1)得: $4 y=4$ 解得: $y=1 \quad \therefore$ 方程组的解为 $\left\{\begin{array}{l}x=3 \\ y=1\end{array}\right.$;

(3) $\left\{\begin{array}{l}2 x+3 y+z=11(1) \\ x+y+z=6(2) \\ 3 x+y-z=2(3)\end{array}\right.$ (1)-(2得: $x+2 y=5$ (4) (2)+(3)得: $4 x+2 y=8(5)$ (5)-(4)得: $3 x=3$ 解得: $x=1$把 $x=1$ 代入(4)得: $y=2 \quad$ 把 $x=1, y=2$ 代入(2)得: $z=3$

